WEBVTT

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.890
<i>In the year 2020 C.E.,</i>

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:18.140
<i>the human world is connected by a network.</i>

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:24.060
<i>Inhabiting it is
an unknown life form called Digimon.</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.130
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.130
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.220
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.220
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.980
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.980
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.990
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.990
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.200
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.200
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.370
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.370
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.800
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.800
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:37.590
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:37.590
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.470
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.470
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.690
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.690
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.570
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.570
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.360
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.360
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:04.200
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:04.200
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.580
<i>A cyberterrorism incident
suddenly hit Tokyo.</i>

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:14.420
<i>This was just the beginning
for the boy, Taichi Yagami,</i>

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:19.090
<i>and the mysterious life forms
living within the Network, Digimon.</i>

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:27.940
<i>Taichi teamed up with his friends
and Agumon, the Digimon he bonded with.</i>

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:33.360
<i>They stopped a military missile crisis
caused by an unknown Digimon</i>

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.400
<i>and succeeded in protecting mankind.</i>

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:43.200
<i>The children's small adventure
came to an end.</i>

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.420
<i>They returned to their lives
as if it was all a dream...</i>

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.250
<i>to a peaceful summer vacation.</i>

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:59.340
<i>However, disaster strikes again.</i>

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.140
<i>An unidentified power outage
spreads in Tokyo.</i>

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:15.110
<i>The city is about to
completely stop functioning in 72 hours.</i>

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:20.450
<i>They are the only ones who can stop it.</i>

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:25.240
<i>Taichi wishes strongly
and calls out Agumon's name.</i>

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.620
<i>To fight together once more...</i>

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.740
The Digital... World...

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:09.350
AGUMON

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.240
Welcome, Taichi.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.540
Agumon,

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.460
good to see you again.

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.040
Oh!

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.250
Huh?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:20.760
What's wrong?

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.220
It's Koshiro!

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:26.140
Another disaster occurred in our world,

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:29.520
and he should've come here
with me to stop it...

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:30.970
Huh?

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:36.730
Sora?!

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.580
Oh, Taichi!

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.990
Where are we? Overseas?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.780
My phone won't work...

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.740
Looks like it won't turn on.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.620
How come?
Why is it you instead of Koshiro?

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.040
Hm?

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.500
Hey, is that...

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.300
possibly a dinosaur?

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:03.550
I'm a Digimon!

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:05.050
You can speak?!

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.390
This is Agumon!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.140
Agumon?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.370
I wonder what this is...

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:45.970
"Children,

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.680
come to the place
where the light leads you."

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:53.680
BIRDRAMON SOARS

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:57.770
Huh?

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.690
How was I able to read that?

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.330
I guess it means to head that way...

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.670
What do we do, Taichi?

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.510
The reason why we came to this world,

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.430
and the source of the problem in Tokyo...

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:33.100
Do the answers lie beyond there?

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:37.180
I don't really understand...

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:41.400
But if there's no other choice,
we have to go, right?

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.360
That's true.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.190
There's no time to think...

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:51.370
So let's just head on over!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:03.520
STEGOMON

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:04.040
Didn't know there were
so many different Digimon!

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.590
That's Stegomon.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.800
So huge!

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:12.110
BRAKIMON

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.550
That's Brakimon.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.050
Brakimon's super strong.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.560
You two, I'm leaving you guys behind!

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:23.060
Huh?

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.570
Whoa!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:27.860
You scared me...

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.570
Are you a Digimon too?

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.450
What's that?!

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:34.320
That's...

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.180
SNIMON

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.580
Snimon!

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.750
What's this all of a sudden?!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.840
Snimon thinks we stole its food!

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:05.730
Agumon!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:06.610
Yeah!

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:10.860
Baby Flame!

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:18.290
Sora, go on ahead!

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.060
Baby Flame!

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.940
Taichi, now's our chance too!

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.280
Right!

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.710
What do we do, Taichi?

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.380
We jump.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.090
Sora, you good?

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:10.050
Yeah!

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:12.210
You too... okay?

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.790
Achoo!

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.840
Ah, we're saved...

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.180
Everyone's okay?

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.050
Yeah.

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:01.560
Thanks to you and Agumon.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:04.560
You two looked cool fighting back there!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.140
You guys make a great team.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.860
I see now.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:18.570
So you and Koshiro-kun were secretly
talking about Digimon all this time.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.200
But how strange.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:28.960
Who would've thought
a world like this existed inside the Net?

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.380
Koshiro!

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:38.090
<i>Taichi-san! I'm so glad!</i>

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.010
<i>Where are you right now?!</i>

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:44.680
I think I'm at the same place
you wound up last time.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:45.810
And you?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.810
<i>A place called the Digital World,
supposedly.</i>

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.560
<i>There are tons of Digimon
and there's nature.</i>

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.230
<i>It feels completely different
from your side.</i>

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.360
<i>Oh, Sora's here too!</i>

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.070
Uh, Sora-san too?

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.240
<i>Koshiro-kun!</i>

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:01.370
<i>Hi!</i>

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.120
<i>Can't believe Sora-san's there too.</i>

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.790
Are you surprised?

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.540
I am too!

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:09.120
<i>Hello there!</i>

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:14.630
<i>It's a pleasure to meet you.
I call myself Tentomon.</i>

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.730
TENTOMON

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.130
<i>Tentomon?!</i>

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.550
So you're Taichi-san!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.890
Thank you for looking after Koshiro-san.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:27.390
I met Tentomon over here
and learned many things.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:31.940
<i>It seems like the Digital World lies
inside the most deepest part</i>

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:34.730
<i>of the Network world.</i>

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:36.480
Taichi-san.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:40.650
Tokyo's power outage
is gradually spreading as I expected.

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:45.200
There's approximately 72 hours
until a complete blackout...

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:50.620
Before the city comes to a halt,
we must identify the cause.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:52.540
<i>Koshiro.</i>

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:56.420
<i>We have someplace to go at the moment.</i>

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:00.300
We might be able
to get ahold of some clues there.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:01.720
<i>I understand.</i>

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:06.310
<i>There must be a reason
why we came to this world.</i>

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.930
<i>If I find anything new,
I'll notify you right away.</i>

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:13.560
Yeah, we're counting on you, Koshiro.

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:14.940
<i>Then see you again!</i>

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:20.690
The light was pointing
towards that mountain,

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:24.490
so I think we'll reach it
if we go along this river.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.040
It'll take forever if we walk.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.450
Hmm...

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.210
Oh yeah!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:35.630
I was on my way home from shopping.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:40.460
I went to buy emergency supplies,
but I ended up buying other things too.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:43.470
Wow, these are perfect!

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.140
Found it!

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.890
We'll make a raft.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.470
For river rafting!

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:51.480
Ooh! Let's go with that!

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:53.480
Agumon, give me a hand.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:55.650
First, we get the wood!

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:56.900
Okay!

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.490
I'm glad you're awake!

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:07.570
Sora...

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:08.950
Huh?

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:12.580
Sora!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.040
I'm Piyomon!

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:17.500
I was waiting for you, Sora!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.130
For me?

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:30.370
PIYOMON

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.260
The breeze feels great.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:30.260
Yeah.

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:32.140
Don't fall off, Agumon!

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:34.270
I'll be fine, Taichi.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:38.980
Sora...

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:42.280
Thank you for saving me earlier.

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:46.990
It felt really warm to be in your arms...

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:50.030
I'll fight next time too!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.700
All right.

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.410
Let's fight together, Piyomon.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:56.540
Okay!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.250
It's a rapid stream!

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:04.170
Hang on tight!

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.480
Looks like we're okay now.

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:05.980
We made it out somehow...

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.490
It's not over yet, Taichi!

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.740
There's something there!

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:23.860
COELAMON

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.500
Coelamon!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.940
We're not your food!

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:49.030
Baby Flame!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:03.670
Agumon!

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.670
Agumon!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:34.410
Agumon Evolution!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.000
Greymon!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.070
GREYMON

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:53.830
Evolution?!

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:57.800
Greymon!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.240
Incredible!

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.200
Snimon!

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.420
Piyomon!

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:37.800
Piyomon!

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:38.680
Huh?!

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.510
Sora?!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.270
Hold on!

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.190
I'm coming right now!

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:51.280
No, Sora! It's dangerous!

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:53.190
Don't give up!

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:57.320
Remember? You said let's fight together.

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:00.200
I won't give up...

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.290
so you can't either!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:03.660
Sora...

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:13.010
Magical Fire!

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:17.970
Sora!

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.640
Piyomon!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:36.070
Piyomon Evolution!

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.290
That's...

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:57.400
BIRDRAMON

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.630
Birdramon!

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:00.680
Piyomon... evolved too.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:02.890
Birdramon...

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:09.810
Sora, your warm heart gave me power.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:13.070
I will fight with you too!

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:16.900
Yeah!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:35.130
Birdramon!

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.590
Hang on tight!

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:52.150
Meteor Wing!

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:14.170
Mega Flame!

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:40.190
Huh?

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.360
Agumon?

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:44.530
Once I relaxed, I changed back.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.410
Birdramon, you were awesome!

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:51.290
It's all thank to you.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.790
You did great, Sora!

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:01.800
Hey, isn't that the place
where the light pointed?

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:05.300
Looks like there's something
in front of the mountain...

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:16.100
Is it... a temple?

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:20.110
If we go now, I can use my powers
to take everyone there.

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:21.320
Let's hurry!

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:34.920
Tentomon.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:35.670
Yes?

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:39.250
How long does it take
to the Digital World from here?

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:43.090
Uh, with my speed,
it would take quite a...

00:21:43.590 --> 00:21:44.630
Hm?

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>As if rolling out of control,
I ran frantically</i>

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:07.280
<i>korogaru youni gamushara ni hashitta</i>

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:11.160
<i>"What's waiting ahead?"</i>

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:11.160
<i>nani ga matteru no?</i>

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:17.670
<i>The headwinds told me</i>

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:17.670
<i>mukaikaze ga oshiete kuretanda</i>

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>"Just believe and move forward"</i>

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>shinjite susume</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.380
<i>yaburete shitta kuyashisa wa tane</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.380
<i>The bitter taste of defeat is a seed</i>

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:27.010
<i>It will eventually sprout
And become your wings</i>

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:27.010
<i>yagate mebuki hane to naru</i>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:30.850
<i>I knock on those doors</i>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:30.850
<i>sono tobira tataku riyuu</i>

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:36.690
<i>Because the present shapes the future</i>

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:36.690
<i>ima ga mirai wo tsukuru kara</i>

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:38.980
<i>If you want to find a rainbow</i>

00:22:36.810 --> 00:22:38.980
<i>niji wo mitsuketai nara</i>

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>You must lift your face</i>

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>kao wo agenakuchatte</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:47.400
<i>The hands that reached out to us
Make us much stronger</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:47.400
<i>sashidasareta te ga
bokura wo zutto tsuyoku suru</i>

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.490
<i>If you want to catch your dreams</i>

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.490
<i>yume wo tsukamitai nara</i>

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:52.780
<i>Though the step forward is unsteady</i>

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:52.780
<i>furueru sono ippo mae ni</i>

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.540
<i>Try and take it</i>

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:55.540
<i>fumi dashite goran yo</i>

00:22:55.660 --> 00:23:00.540
<i>Because you can surely fly now</i>

